{"4344000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Complete Horror", "steam_appid": 4344000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up alone in an abandoned subway station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No memories. No signal. No way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is <strong>very wrong</strong> here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The staff... they're still moving. Wandering endlessly in the dark. Something worse waits deeper down — twisted things that were never human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step reveals more questions. Every answer brings you closer to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This disaster was no accident.</strong> <strong>And your awakening... was no coincidence.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344000/extras/598c79e1e3283a80f1b1d97da16ebe39.poster.avif?t=1787682105\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344000/extras/598c79e1e3283a80f1b1d97da16ebe39.webm?t=1787682105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344000/extras/598c79e1e3283a80f1b1d97da16ebe39.mp4?t=1787682105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Third-Person Female Protagonist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a third-person female protagonist equipped with firearms and customizable outfits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As exploration progresses, players can obtain new weapons and clothing to survive increasingly dangerous areas.<br>The combat system features rich animations, including execution moves, melee combat, and ranged gunplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344000/extras/cc6ea7146f2a4aacb7ec37796cdf25f5.avif?t=1787682105\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344000/extras_big/cc6ea7146f2a4aacb7ec37796cdf25f5.avif?t=1787682105 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344000/extras/3685283e9e64bed58a33c6af5abba869.avif?t=1787682105\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344000/extras_big/3685283e9e64bed58a33c6af5abba869.avif?t=1787682105 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape before your sanity completely collapses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration and survival are equally important.<br>The subway station is composed of multiple interconnected areas.<br>Players must explore under limited time and resources, searching for key items and routes to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344000/extras/7497e7d3c0febbe0e3e0fb54d88d9e5e.avif?t=1787682105\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344000/extras_big/7497e7d3c0febbe0e3e0fb54d88d9e5e.avif?t=1787682105 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Environmental Storytelling</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game does not directly explain the full story.<br>Instead, players piece together the truth through environmental details, documents, and changes within the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A second playthrough offers a different experience from the first, revealing new details and perspectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344000/extras/4759d6563bf3c69920d17798aa767957.avif?t=1787682105\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344000/extras_big/4759d6563bf3c69920d17798aa767957.avif?t=1787682105 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzle Design</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interconnected Environmental Puzzles</strong><br>Each area features puzzles tightly integrated with the environment, guiding players deeper into different sections of the subway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Danger During Problem-Solving</strong><br>Enemies and environmental threats may appear at any time while solving puzzles, keeping tension constant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344000/extras/d2813207236b26b8976a9c470912960b.avif?t=1787682105\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344000/extras_big/d2813207236b26b8976a9c470912960b.avif?t=1787682105 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat and Survival System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource-Driven Combat</strong><br>Ammunition and healing items are scarce, forcing players to carefully choose between fighting and evasion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344000/extras/7817763e57744736cabb586b2643b5ae.avif?t=1787682105\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344000/extras_big/7817763e57744736cabb586b2643b5ae.avif?t=1787682105 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enemy Variety</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features both zombies and special mutated creatures.<br>Each enemy type has unique behaviors and weaknesses, requiring different strategies to overcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344000/extras/e5c38c99dd78a4eac204b0977210c4e6.avif?t=1787682105\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344000/extras_big/e5c38c99dd78a4eac204b0977210c4e6.avif?t=1787682105 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up alone in an abandoned subway station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No memories. No signal. No way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is <strong>very wrong</strong> here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The staff... they're still moving. Wandering endlessly in the dark. Something worse waits deeper down — twisted things that were never human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step reveals more questions. Every answer brings you closer to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This disaster was no accident.</strong> <strong>And your awakening... was no coincidence.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344000/extras/598c79e1e3283a80f1b1d97da16ebe39.poster.avif?t=1787682105\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344000/extras/598c79e1e3283a80f1b1d97da16ebe39.webm?t=1787682105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344000/extras/598c79e1e3283a80f1b1d97da16ebe39.mp4?t=1787682105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Third-Person Female Protagonist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a third-person female protagonist equipped with firearms and customizable outfits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As exploration progresses, players can obtain new weapons and clothing to survive increasingly dangerous areas.<br>The combat system features rich animations, including execution moves, melee combat, and ranged gunplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344000/extras/cc6ea7146f2a4aacb7ec37796cdf25f5.avif?t=1787682105\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344000/extras_big/cc6ea7146f2a4aacb7ec37796cdf25f5.avif?t=1787682105 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344000/extras/3685283e9e64bed58a33c6af5abba869.avif?t=1787682105\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344000/extras_big/3685283e9e64bed58a33c6af5abba869.avif?t=1787682105 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape before your sanity completely collapses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration and survival are equally important.<br>The subway station is composed of multiple interconnected areas.<br>Players must explore under limited time and resources, searching for key items and routes to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344000/extras/7497e7d3c0febbe0e3e0fb54d88d9e5e.avif?t=1787682105\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344000/extras_big/7497e7d3c0febbe0e3e0fb54d88d9e5e.avif?t=1787682105 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Environmental Storytelling</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game does not directly explain the full story.<br>Instead, players piece together the truth through environmental details, documents, and changes within the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A second playthrough offers a different experience from the first, revealing new details and perspectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344000/extras/4759d6563bf3c69920d17798aa767957.avif?t=1787682105\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344000/extras_big/4759d6563bf3c69920d17798aa767957.avif?t=1787682105 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzle Design</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interconnected Environmental Puzzles</strong><br>Each area features puzzles tightly integrated with the environment, guiding players deeper into different sections of the subway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Danger During Problem-Solving</strong><br>Enemies and environmental threats may appear at any time while solving puzzles, keeping tension constant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344000/extras/d2813207236b26b8976a9c470912960b.avif?t=1787682105\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344000/extras_big/d2813207236b26b8976a9c470912960b.avif?t=1787682105 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat and Survival System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource-Driven Combat</strong><br>Ammunition and healing items are scarce, forcing players to carefully choose between fighting and evasion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344000/extras/7817763e57744736cabb586b2643b5ae.avif?t=1787682105\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344000/extras_big/7817763e57744736cabb586b2643b5ae.avif?t=1787682105 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enemy Variety</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features both zombies and special mutated creatures.<br>Each enemy type has unique behaviors and weaknesses, requiring different strategies to overcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344000/extras/e5c38c99dd78a4eac204b0977210c4e6.avif?t=1787682105\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344000/extras_big/e5c38c99dd78a4eac204b0977210c4e6.avif?t=1787682105 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "short_description": "This is a horror survival game.Join the female protagonist to explore an abandoned subway station full of mysteries, seeking escape in oppressive darkness. Balance exploration, puzzles, and combat—one mistake may plunge you into endless abyss. Arm yourself constantly to face terrors from the depths.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Turkish, Japanese, Polish, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344000/dd9e533f0e258f352376aea03ee1ef12c33d5769/header.jpg?t=1787682105", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344000/81746b3c78fcd23efdf2bffe176f9571d4513853/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787682105", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344000/81746b3c78fcd23efdf2bffe176f9571d4513853/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787682105", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows 10 / Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 / AMD Ryzen 5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br>